{"3779580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gyre", "steam_appid": 3779580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gyre is a unique space-themed Match 3 game!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place planets on three orbits, then the orbits spin - each one at a different speed. Line up three of the same planet  and they pop.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/a9f11fbd49bff9720c37d6e04ad48cb2.poster.avif?t=1786908570\" width=1170 height=1142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/a9f11fbd49bff9720c37d6e04ad48cb2.webm?t=1786908570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/a9f11fbd49bff9720c37d6e04ad48cb2.mp4?t=1786908570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pop more than one line at once and your score multiplies. Fill the board and it's game over. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/0cda86d38fb8a6d713a5497823b13ab5.poster.avif?t=1786908570\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/0cda86d38fb8a6d713a5497823b13ab5.webm?t=1786908570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/0cda86d38fb8a6d713a5497823b13ab5.mp4?t=1786908570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gyre is a unique space-themed Match 3 game!</strong> </h2><p cl